      "text": {
        "hi": "‘मुझे पसंद है’ = I like. जैसे: I like mangoes = मुझे आम पसंद हैं।",
        "hinglish": "‘Mujhe pasand hai’ = I like. Jaise: I like mangoes = Mujhe aam pasand hain.",
        "en": "Say ‘I like’ for things you enjoy: I like mangoes."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U07.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.like"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "हिंदी: मुझे + चीज़ + पसंद है। इंग्लिश: I + like + चीज़। ‘like’ बीच में आता है!",
        "hinglish": "Hindi: mujhe + cheez + pasand hai. English: I + like + cheez. ‘like’ beech mein aata hai!",
        "en": "Hindi says the thing first, then ‘pasand hai’. English says: I + like + the thing."
      }
    },
